       "text": "The conditional probability mass function of \\(X\\) given that \\(Y=y\\) (where \\(p_Y(y)>0\\)) is defined as: \\[p_{X|Y}(x\\mid y)=P(X=x\\mid Y=y)=\\frac{p_{X,Y}(x,y)}{p_Y(y)}\\]",
